{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Get in Touch — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach {{THERAPIST_NAME}} at {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — confidential, trauma-informed therapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0b0b0c; /* deep editorial */
      --panel:#ffffff;
      --muted:#9aa3ad;
      --accent:#e8b4b1; /* gentle rose */
      --accent-dark:#bf8f8d;
      --max-width:980px;
      --radius:12px;
      --neutral-2:#f6f7f8;
      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
      color:var(--panel);
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg) 0%, #111213 60%);
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      line-height:1.5;
    }
    .container{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:40px auto;padding:28px}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-dark),var(--accent));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#111}
    .brand h1{font-family: Georgia, serif;font-size:20px;margin:0}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--panel);text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;opacity:0.9}
    nav a.active{font-weight:700}

    .layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start}

    /* Hero */
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);padding:34px;border-radius:var(--radius);display:flex;gap:24px}
    .hero-left{flex:1}
    .eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.06em;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px}
    .hero h2{font-size:34px;margin:0 0 12px 0;line-height:1.05;font-family: Georgia, serif}
    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial}

    .hero-right{width:240px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .avatar{width:240px;height:240px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--neutral-2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden}
    .avatar img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}

    /* form panel */
    .panel{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:22px;border-radius:12px}
    .panel h3{margin:0 0 10px 0;font-family: Georgia, serif}
    label{display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type="text"],input[type="email"],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;margin-top:6px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);color:var(--panel);outline:none}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .actions{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#111;border:none;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .link-btn{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--panel)}

    /* trust */
    .trust{margin-top:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .testimonial{background:var(--glass);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--panel)}

    /* extras */
    .card{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:16px;border-radius:10px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .list{margin:12px 0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--panel)}

    footer{margin-top:40px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    @media (max-width:880px){
      .layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .hero-right{width:120px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div>
          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
          <div class="muted">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
        <a href="specialties.html">Specialties</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Approach</a>
        <a href="book.html" class="active">Work With Me</a>
        <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="layout">
      <section>
        <div class="hero">
          <div class="hero-left">
            <div class="eyebrow">Private practice therapy</div>
            <h2>Reach out when you feel ready — I will hold space for what matters most</h2>
            <p>I offer a calm, evidence-informed practice for adults navigating anxiety, trauma, relationship challenges, caregiving strain, and life transitions. I blend somatic awareness with relational work so you feel seen and steady in therapy. Licensed in {{STATE}}.</p>

            <div style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
              <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
              <a class="link-btn" href="book.html">Schedule a Consult</a>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:18px" class="muted">Sessions offered via telehealth and limited in-person availability in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Confidentiality is honored; sessions are private and records are kept securely.</div>

          </div>

          <div class="hero-right">
            <div class="avatar">
              <img src="assets/img/avatar.svg" alt="Portrait illustration" />
            </div>
            <div class="card" style="text-align:center">
              <div style="font-weight:700">{{THERAPIST_NAME}}</div>
              <div class="muted">{{LICENSE}} • {{MODALITIES}}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:18px">
          <div class="card">
            <strong>What I commonly support</strong>
            <ul class="list">
              <li>Anxiety and rumination</li>
              <li>Trauma and complex responses</li>
              <li>Relationship patterns and communication</li>
              <li>Burnout, caregiving stress, life transitions</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <strong>How I work</strong>
            <ol class="list">
              <li>Slow, curiosity-led intake to understand your priorities</li>
              <li>Collaborative goal-setting; practical skills + reflection</li>
              <li>Regular check-ins on progress and pacing</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:18px">
          <div class="trust">
            <div class="testimonial">“I finally felt safe to talk about hard things. The steady guidance and practical tools helped me breathe through panic and set better boundaries.” — Client in {{CITY}}</div>
            <div class="testimonial">“Therapy with {{THERAPIST_NAME}} was clear, compassionate, and never rushed. Small changes added up to real relief.” — Client</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section style="margin-top:22px">
          <h3 style="font-family: Georgia, serif;margin-bottom:8px">Questions I often hear</h3>
          <div class="card">
            <p class="muted"><strong>How long are sessions and how often?</strong><br/>Most clients begin with 50-minute weekly sessions. We review frequency after the initial phase and adapt for your needs.</p>
            <p class="muted"><strong>Do you take insurance?</strong><br/>I offer private pay and provide superbills for insurance reimbursement upon request. Please contact me to discuss specifics.</p>
            <p class="muted"><strong>Is telehealth an option?</strong><br/>Yes — I provide secure telehealth across {{STATE}}; in-person availability is limited in {{CITY}}.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section style="margin-top:22px">
          <h3 style="font-family: Georgia, serif;margin-bottom:8px">Lead resource — free intake guide</h3>
          <div class="card">
            <p class="muted">Download a short worksheet to prepare for your first session: "Starting the Conversation: An Intake Guide". It helps you notice what matters most and brings clarity to your first meeting.</p>
            <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Get the intake guide</a>
          </div>
        </section>

      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="panel">
          <h3>Contact form</h3>
          <form action="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" method="post" autocomplete="off">
            <label for="name">Full name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your name" required />

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required />

            <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
            <input id="phone" name="phone" type="text" placeholder="(555) 555-5555" />

            <label for="method">Preferred contact</label>
            <select id="method" name="method">
              <option>Email</option>
              <option>Phone</option>
            </select>

            <label for="message">Brief note about what you'd like support with</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="A short description helps me prepare for our first conversation."></textarea>

            <label style="margin-top:10px"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required /> I consent to being contacted and understand this is not an emergency service.</label>

            <div class="actions">
              <button class="btn" type="submit">Send inquiry</button>
              <a class="link-btn" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">Or email: {{EMAIL}}</a>
            </div>
          </form>

          <div style="margin-top:12px" class="muted">
            Confidentiality & privacy: communications through this form are treated as confidential and retained according to {{BUSINESS_NAME}} practice policies. For more details, see the privacy section on the site or email {{EMAIL}}.
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:10px" class="muted">
            Please note: I do not provide crisis services. If you are in immediate danger or are experiencing a psychiatric emergency, call 911 or go to your nearest emergency department. For urgent mental health support, contact your local crisis line.
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--panel)">
            <strong>{{THERAPIST_NAME}}</strong><br/>
            {{LICENSE}} • {{MODALITIES}}<br/>
            {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--panel);text-decoration:underline">{{PHONE}}</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:18px" class="card">
          <strong>Intake & timing</strong>
          <p class="muted">I typically schedule an initial 20–30 minute phone consult to see if we're a good fit before starting full sessions. That helps us clarify goals and logistics.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:18px" class="card">
          <strong>Payment options</strong>
          <p class="muted">I offer session packages and monthly plans for ongoing work. I provide superbills for insurance reimbursement. For exact rates and available openings, please inquire above.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px">
        <div>&copy; <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong> • {{THERAPIST_NAME}} • {{LICENSE}}</div>
        <div class="muted">Licensed in {{STATE}} • Confidentiality and boundaries are discussed at intake. Not a crisis service.</div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:10px" class="muted">Illustrations: local SVGs embedded in the project (assets/img/hero.svg, assets/img/avatar.svg, assets/img/pattern.svg)</div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"This chunk contains two files for the private practice therapist site (layoutFamily: aura_editorial).

Files included:
- contact.html — Full contact page with hero, social proof, benefits, process overview, FAQ snippets, lead-magnet CTA, contact form, confidentiality and crisis disclaimers, and therapist details.
- README.md — This file (instructions and notes).

Placeholders to replace before publishing:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{THERAPIST_NAME}}
- {{LICENSE}}
- {{MODALITIES}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes and guidance:
- The contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. Replace with your form endpoint or an appointment booking URL, or update the form to use a backend handler.
- Assets referenced in the HTML (assets/img/avatar.svg, assets/img/hero.svg, assets/img/pattern.svg) should be provided locally in the assets/img/ directory. Each SVG should be unique and created for this project.
- The page intentionally avoids claims about cures or guarantees. It includes confidentiality and crisis disclaimers that must remain visible.
- Styling is inline and crafted for an "aura_editorial" aesthetic: high-contrast, bold typographic scale, calm accent color. Adjust CSS variables at the top of contact.html to tweak colors and spacing.

Accessibility & ethics reminders:
- Keep the crisis and emergency language intact. Do not present therapy as emergency intervention.
- Ensure any downloadable lead magnet respects client privacy (no collection of protected health information without consent).

How to preview locally:
1) Place contact.html and README.md in a folder.
2) Add the referenced SVGs into assets/img/.
3) Open contact.html in a browser.

If you need the other pages in this site (index, about, specialties, approach, fees, faq, book), ask for the remaining chunks. Each page will use the required section pack (hero, social_proof, benefits, process, faq, lead_magnet, cta) and maintain consistent placeholders and tone."}
BUNDLE_END
